uminum made and when you use an  ortho site you can produce zero waste  and so it is a truly a green green  product while any mining scars the  landscape greenland's government is  looking for minerals with low climate  impact and so far another site stands  out  even nasa wants to know more about the  benefits of mining anorthocyte because  the only larger deposits of the mineral  than here in greenland is on the moon  eric sorensen global news toronto  and that is global national for this  friday night i'm farah nasser thank you  so much for spending part of your  evening with us tonight's your canada is  madeira park on bc's sunshine coast we  love seeing your canada so please email  us your pictures at viewers at  globalnational.com  nico garcia will be on the anchor desk  with you tomorrow until next time take  care of yourselves and each other  [Music]

